# Text files: stored and checked out with LF on every system, so «python scripts/rehacer_todo.py --comprobar» compares
# content, not line endings, on Windows, Mac and Linux
* text=auto eol=lf
# Downloaded files stay byte for byte as they came: their hashes are compared with the portal's (verificar_descargas.py)
data/raw/** -text
data/raw_*/** -text
# Binary files
*.png binary
*.sqlite binary
*.zip binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.xlsx binary
